<title>MALAYSIA: SQUASH-WOMEN'S WORLD OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-WOMEN'S WORLD OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PETALING JAYA, Malaysia 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final</p>
<p>results in the women's World Open squash tournament on Friday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>5-Liz Irving (Australia) beat 1-Michelle Martin (Australia) 4-9</p>
<p>10-9 9-5 9-5</p>
<p>4-Cassie Jackman (England) beat 8-Sabine Schone (Germany) 9-2</p>
<p>9-2 9-4</p>
<p>2-Sarah Fitz-Gerald (Australia) beat 6-Carol Owens (Australia)</p>
<p>9-2 9-1 9-1</p>
<p>7-Sue Wright (England) beat 3-Suzanne Horner (England) 9-4 9-0</p>
<p>9-4</p>
</text>
